---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact" description="How to reach Scam-Proof Money to report a mistake or suggest a scam guide.">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Contact us</h1>
    <p class="lead">Found a mistake, or want us to cover a scam? We read every message.</p>

    <h2>Send us a message</h2>
    <p>Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@scamproofmoney.com">hello@scamproofmoney.com</a>.</p>
    <p>You can also message our Facebook page, or leave a comment on a YouTube video.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/scamproofmoney" rel="noopener">Scam-Proof Money on Facebook</a><br />
      <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@scamproofmoney" rel="noopener">Scam-Proof Money on YouTube</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Please don't send us</h2>
    <ul class="plain">
      <li>Passwords, bank or card numbers, or ID numbers.</li>
      <li>Requests to check whether one specific message is real. We can't confirm that, but the <a href="/check/">checker</a> and the <a href="/red-flags/">warning signs</a> can help you decide.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>If you've lost money</h2>
    <p>
      We can't recover money or investigate scams. Contact your bank first, then report it to the right
      agency for your country. <a href="/been-scammed/">Start here</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
